sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EnergyTransferStarted

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfilePurpose = TxDefaultProfile)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxDefaultProfile<br>chargingProfile.chargingProfileKind is Absolute OR Recurring<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.startSchedule must NOT be omitted<br>If chargingProfileKind is Recurring then chargingProfile.recurrencyKind must NOT be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (chargingProfilePurpose = ChargingStationMaxProfile)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.id must be different from the id of the chargingProfile at step 1<br>chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be ChargingStationMaxProfile<br>chargingProfile.chargingProfileKind is Absolute<br>chargingProfile.chargingSchedule.startSchedule must NOT be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    Note over CSMS: Validation: The received Charging Profiles must comply with the requirements defined at part 2 specification
    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
